<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telecomm equipment companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telecomm equipment companies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of several telecommunications equipment companies.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown analyst Mike Gordon was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of World Access Inc and Westell Technologies Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said started Tellabs Inc and Larscom Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said started DSC Communications Corp and Lucent Technologies Inc as a market perform.</p>
<p>-- said upgraded Newbridge Networks Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
</text>
